      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Dosing into the 400-500mg range for a short burst is an aggressive strategy that definitely moves beyond standard recommendations for rapid saturation. While some biohackers chase this, significantly higher doses can put stress on your digestive system and liver, potentially leading to gastrointestinal distress or iron overload if not managed carefully. For a sustainable and truly optimized edge, a more controlled, consistent approach while monitoring absorption with binders like chelated forms is usually safer and more effective long-term.",
      "source": "target",
